OL,3,CGrandad of missing Ben Needham dies
OL,5,FKerry Needham, the mother of Ben
OL,6,FNeedham, has confirmed that her father
OL,7,FEddie died earlier this week.
OL,9,FEddie, 77, was renovating a remote
OL,10,Ffarmhouse in Kos, Greece, in July 1991
OL,11,Fwhen his grandson went missing from
OL,12,Foutside, and there has been no trace
OL,13,Fsince.
OL,15,FBen, who was 21 months old, had been
OL,16,Ftaken to the location in the remote
OL,17,Fvillage of Irakles by his grandmother
OL,18,FChristine. The family had moved to the
OL,19,Fisland earlier in 1991 for a new life.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
